This project uses Project Guardian memory.

Before editing code or answering project-specific questions, read:
- PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
- STATE.md
- DECISIONS.md
- docs/AI_CHANGELOG.md
- docs/HANDOVER.md

After AI-assisted code changes:
- Update STATE.md with current status, known issues, next steps, and latest change.
- Append a concise entry to docs/AI_CHANGELOG.md.
- Update DECISIONS.md for important architecture, business-rule, dependency, data-model, or compatibility decisions.

Answers should explain not only what to change, but also why the project currently works this way.
